{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato","soma"],"title":"Vīrā","html":"<article id='thig1.7'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Therīgāthā 1.7 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Nuns 1.7 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Bhikkhunīs </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Chapter of the Ones </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Vīrātherīgāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Vīrā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Vīrā </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Vīrā vīrehi dhammehi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>She’s known as Vīrā because of her heroic qualities, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>“Vīrā, with the qualities of a hero, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>bhikkhunī bhāvitindriyā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>a nun with faculties developed. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>is a bhikkhunī with well-developed spiritual powers. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Dhāreti antimaṁ dehaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>She bears her final body, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>She carries her last body, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>jetvā māraṁ savāhinin”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>having vanquished Māra with his legions. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>having conquered Māra and his army.” </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Vīrā therī …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>The Elder Vīrā </span></p></article>"}
